Thanks thus far for the responses from the following:

Brian Sheehan <sheehan@scripps.edu>
Paul Gavazzi <gavazzi@access.digex.net>
Christian Miranda <cmiranda@gmd.com.pe>

The response from Christian Miranda triggered a few synapses.

The solution:

All I had to do was change the following in /etc/remotes:

From:

UNIX-9600|9600 Baud dial-out to another UNIX system:\
        :el=^U^C^R^O^D^S^Q@:ie=#%$:oe=^D:tc=dial9600:
        
To:

UNIX-9600|9600 Baud dial-out to another UNIX system:\
        :el=^U^C^R^O^D^S^Q@:ie=#%$:oe=^D:tc=dial9600:\
        :dv=/dev/ttyd0:


