	 I  have  configured  my  new  RZ26L  using  ADVFS  as  I
wanted  to  do  so.

	Special   thanks  to  immediate detailed  inputs from  the
following  folks:

> 	Dr. Tom Blinn[SMTP:tpb@zk3.dec.com] 
